ult-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those 75 years. On the middle of the grids, September to October 2025 came in at 47% of normal, while June to July 2025 hit 174%. So far in 2026, May to June sits at 68% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 28045 had its driest year in 1958 at 54%.</p>"}
